# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: KINGDOM OF STORIES
## The Veil of Forgotten Chronicles

Act as a senior 3D game developer, creative director, UI/UX designer, educational game designer, narrative designer, and full-stack web developer.

Your task is to design and develop a high-quality, fully playable, browser-based 3D educational adventure game titled **KINGDOM OF STORIES: The Veil of Forgotten Chronicles**.

This project is an interactive Digital Learning Object (DLO) developed for a teacher education assignment. It must combine immersive 3D gameplay, mystery storytelling, gamification, Project-Based Learning (PBL), authentic learning, collaborative learning, and adaptive learning.

**MOST IMPORTANT REQUIREMENT: THIS MUST BE A REAL, PLAYABLE 3D GAME.**

Do not create a static 3D illustration, slideshow, animated presentation, dashboard disguised as a game, or a website that only changes background images when users click buttons.

The player must be able to control a 3D character, explore actual 3D environments, walk and run through the world, interact with objects and NPCs, complete missions, collect items, and physically teleport through portals into separate 3D environments.

The final product must prioritize premium visual quality and immersive gameplay while maintaining functional, responsive, and reliable game mechanics.

